<title>POLAND: NBP DRAINS PLN 178 MLN FROM POLISH MONEY MARKET.</title>
<headline>NBP DRAINS PLN 178 MLN FROM POLISH MONEY MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland drained 178 million zlotys from the market through a reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction after banks bid to place 178 million with the central bank, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The bank drained the market for 14 days at an unchanged maximum rate of 21.64 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
